m_community_announcements/1847286114043509","verified_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4333920-1846651706691728","game_id":"steam-4333920","kind":"update","title":"Steam Next Fest demo update is live!","summary":"The version 1.2 demo update is live for Harlequinade! 🎉This update includes:An extended look at the full game, including 1 new scene for both the Harlequin Lynn and the Pierrot Giles2 new side characters, the clown girls Punchy and BrighellaNew artwork, background, and cutscenesMiscellaneous bug fixesNew setting - the ability to hide the MC's character sprite in the textboxThe overall demo is still under 2 hours, depending on your reading speed. You're free to share screenshots or stream the dem","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:20:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691728","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4333920-1844751498226465","game_id":"steam-4333920","kind":"announcement","title":"September Updates – A Few More Clowns","summary":"Hi everyone, September is almost done! Here’s a look at what’s been worked on for Harlequinade~The first draft of Harlequinade is nearing completion, with Giles’ route on its epilogue section and Lynn’s route still in progress. I’ve been focusing on Giles’ route to get a feel for how long the game should be and how the routes should go, rather than jumping between both routes. I’ve also tried incorporating more choices that don’t change the endings but just how the scene plays out, to give you m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T03:44:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226465","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4333920-1842212951314149","game_id":"steam-4333920","kind":"announcement","title":"Fall in Love Visual Novel Steam Festival is live!","summary":"Fall in love with visual novels from September 1-9 in the Fall in Love Visual Novel Festival!Harlequinade is currently taking part in the Fall in Love Visual Novel Festival, a Steam festival dedicated to romance visual novels from around the world, hosted by Studio Élan! From September 1-9 you can find over 200 visual novels in the festival, ranging from discounted games, new demos, and more~A few of our other visual novels are on sale as well!And you can try out the demo for our other upcoming ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T17:00:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951314149","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4333920-1840944183775053","game_id":"steam-4333920","kind":"announcement","title":"August Updates – Pierrot’s Route","summary":"Hi everyone, happy August! July was a very busy month for me—I ended up boothing at 2 conventions, Anime Blues Con and OffKai Expo—but now that it’s August I’ve been able to settle down and resume work on Harlequinade.Next month we’ll be running a Kickstarter for Harlequinade where you can get exclusive merch for the game as well as contribute to it! You can follow the Kickstarter page to be notified when it launches.I was expecting some people to like Pierrot, but I wasn’t expecting so many peo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T21:09:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183775053","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4333920-1835871199308040","game_id":"steam-4333920","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo out now!","summary":"The demo for Harlequinade is now here, just in time to celebrate the Games for Pride sale on Steam!A night of fun turns into a night of horror when you find yourself trapped in a never-ending carnival as the most death-prone college student ever!Harlequinade is a timeloop horror romance visual novel about a college student trapped in a carnival that resets every time they die. Can you trust the clowns there to help you see the day through?In this preview of the carnival, you'll be able to...cust","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-19T19:20:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199308040","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4333920-1832065502822194","game_id":"steam-4333920","kind":"announcement","title":"Harlequinade is part of The Storyteller's Festival!","summary":"Harlequinade is taking part in The Storyteller's Festival this week, alongside 300+ story-driven games hosted by Two and a Half Studios!We also have 2 other visual novels taking part in the festival that you can check out~","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-11T18:41:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502822194","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4333920-1826992588602372","game_id":"steam-4333920","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcing Harlequinade, an upcoming horror timeloop otome game","summary":"As we’re wrapping up development on our current otome game Crimson Waves on the Emerald Sea: Amaranthine Moon, it’s time to announce our next otome game — Harlequinade, a modern timeloop horror romance game!A never-ending carnival and a death-prone college student…Tired from your studies, your friends drag you out for a night of fun out at a traveling carnival. But for some reason, you can’t help but feel the sense of déjà vu…Harlequinade is a horror otome romance visual novel about a never-endi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-16T20:10:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588602372","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4333920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:46Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4333920":"2026-10-26T12:07:46Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4333920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:45Z"},"4833510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:46Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:46Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:46Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4333920","app_id":4333920,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:33Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"e0b28895fa382a1c2a5b985f55633b222e763fa26b0f04e456080f47e9dfeb25","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Harlequinade is a horror otome romance visual novel about a never-ending carnival and a very death-prone college student. With the aid of 2 clowns, can you escape this timeloop?","publishers":[{"name":"Crystal Game Works","creator_clan_account_id":34225902}],"developers"